Testing confirms that a gas spores explosion will not break mirrors or
potions.  I dropped a mirror and potion on the ground.  Then i stood on
that square, next to the gas spore, and killed the gas spore.  The
resulting explosion didn't shatter anything.

As for MF's, my preferred method is to keep a wand of fire (an
identified wand) in my main inventory at all times.  That way I can
burn Elbereth if a MF or MMF is summoned next to me.

I just ascended a wizard who had his brain sucked once on Astra.  A MMF
was summoned next to me and I zapped a WoD at it ... an empty WoD!
Oops!  So I forgot scroll of fire, potion of water, and a gem it
seemed.  I didn't forget any spells though, so that was good.  I
would've been in trouble if I forgot Finger of Death.



